WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.001 --> 00:00:09.334
One day Dad brought home a box.

2
00:00:09.335 --> 00:00:14.103
"What's in there?" asked Oliver.

3
00:00:14.104 --> 00:00:17.712
"It's a surprise for Emmy," said Dad.

4
00:00:17.713 --> 00:00:29.745
"Maybe Emmy would like a pet."

5
00:00:29.746 --> 00:00:34.526
"Emmy loves snakes," said Oliver.

6
00:00:34.527 --> 00:00:38.560
"I bet it's a snake!"

7
00:00:38.561 --> 00:00:42.335
"I think it's a snake too," said Harry.

8
00:00:42.336 --> 00:00:45.336
"Snakes, snakes, snakes!

9
00:00:45.337 --> 00:00:49.895
Emmy talks about them all the time."

10
00:00:49.896 --> 00:00:53.445
"You're right, boys," said Dad.

11
00:00:53.446 --> 00:00:56.839
He took the lid off the box.

12
00:00:56.840 --> 00:01:00.641
"Cool!" said Oliver.

13
00:01:00.642 --> 00:01:03.921
The snake had black-and-white stripes.

14
00:01:03.922 --> 00:01:08.096
Its tongue was shaped like a fork.

15
00:01:08.097 --> 00:01:12.417
"It looks like Emmy's toy snake," said Harry.

16
00:01:12.418 --> 00:01:16.182
Oliver and Harry took the snake outside.

17
00:01:16.183 --> 00:01:22.624
They touched the scales on its head.

18
00:01:22.625 --> 00:01:29.115
They watched it move across the grass.

19
00:01:29.116 --> 00:01:32.627
The snake's tongue flicked in and out.

20
00:01:32.628 --> 00:01:35.589
"Wow," said Oliver.

21
00:01:35.590 --> 00:01:39.734
"This is the best snake ever."

22
00:01:39.735 --> 00:01:43.867
"I know," Harry agreed.

23
00:01:43.868 --> 00:01:49.362
"Wait till Emmy sees this snake."

24
00:01:49.363 --> 00:01:59.878
Finally Emmy came home from soccer practice.

25
00:01:59.879 --> 00:02:02.982
"Guess what, Emmy!" said Harry.

26
00:02:02.983 --> 00:02:08.390
"Dad got you a cool surprise!" said Oliver.

27
00:02:08.391 --> 00:02:14.085
Harry took the lid off the box.

28
00:02:14.086 --> 00:02:19.680
"Agh!" screamed Emmy. "It's a snake!"

29
00:02:19.681 --> 00:02:22.248
"What?" said Dad.

30
00:02:22.249 --> 00:02:26.124
Everyone was confused.

31
00:02:26.125 --> 00:02:29.255
"But you love snakes," said Harry.

32
00:02:29.256 --> 00:02:41.645
"Not real ones!" said Emmy.

